      "writtenOn": "2022-03-07T18:28:34Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "There are several review comments from Ting Shen that need to be addressed.\n\nHas this been tested on an actual device?\n\nIf I understand the description this is saying that disconnecting the keyboard will result in a close event.  I believe this will shut down the device.\n\nWill the user be able to wake up their device?",
      "revId": "75381a0c1e20234ac89b879ead26ff9d62a52e09",
      "serverId": "3ce6091f-6c88-37e8-8c75-72f92ae8dfba"
    },
    {
      "unresolved": false,
      "key": {
        "uuid": "1808bd1b_c416babf",
        "filename": "/PATCHSET_LEVEL",
        "patchSetId": 2
      },
      "lineNbr": 0,
      "author": {
        "id": 1512583
      },
      "writtenOn": "2022-03-08T02:14:09Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "We have tested on actual mrbland device. \n\nWhen the keyboard is disconnected, the lid interrupt is closed and the lid state is switch to open, then a lid_open event is sent to AP, so the DUT is not close at this time.\n\nWhen the keyboard is connected, the user can wake up/close the device by open/close the lid in S0/S3/G3. When the keyboard is disconnected, the user can not trigger DUT response by using external magnet in S0/S3/G3.",
      "parentUuid": "02a0ff9e_4c11b58c",
      "revId": "75381a0c1e20234ac89b879ead26ff9d62a52e09",
      "serverId": "3ce6091f-6c88-37e8-8c75-72f92ae8dfba"
    },
    {
